repository-code: "https://github.com/rocacastro/secant-lie-groups-divided-differences"
url: "https://github.com/rocacastro/secant-lie-groups-divided-differences"

abstract: >-
  High-precision Python code reproducing the numerical experiments in the
  manuscript 'Semilocal Convergence of a Secant-Type Method on Lie Groups via
  Divided Differences'. Version 2.0.0 includes revised derivative-free SO(3)
  experiments based on central function evaluations and exact rank-one secant
  corrections.

keywords:
  - Lie groups
  - secant method
  - divided differences
  - semilocal convergence
  - rank-one secant correction
  - SO(2)
  - SO(3)
  - rotation averaging
  - numerical methods

